### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### IDENTIFICATION TYPES API
### ============================================================

### List all identification types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/identification-types/
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get identification type by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/identification-types/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Create a new identification type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identification-types/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "name": "Passport",
    "description": "International passport"
}

### Update an identification type
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/identification-types/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "name": "National ID",
    "description": "National identification document"
}

### Delete an identification type
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/identification-types/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}
